  title="CCPA Guide: California Privacy Law Explained 2026"
  description="Complete guide to CCPA (California Consumer Privacy Act) and CPRA. Learn about consumer rights, business obligations, and compliance requirements."
  keywords="CCPA guide, California Consumer Privacy Act, CPRA, California privacy law, CCPA compliance, California data privacy"
